{
  "about": "One word per concept on the eval screens, in Polish and German: the glossary in docs/howto/translate.md. Each pattern is a form that reads as a second word for a glossary term. Matched case-insensitively. frontend/messages/eval-terms.test.ts applies it to the catalogs under `scope`; scripts/check_docs_glossary.py to the pages under `docs`.",
  "scope": [
    "evals.",
    "authoring.",
    "mcp.",
    "pages.settings.",
    "pages.backgroundJobs.",
    "pages.channels.",
    "agentTemplates.",
    "steps.",
    "chat.delegation.",
    "context.",
    "datasets.",
    "promotionGate.",
    "pages.runs.",
    "pages.agents.",
    "agents.",
    "triggers.",
    "knowledgeGaps.",
    "dashboard.widgets.",
    "onboarding.",
    "improvement.",
    "unsaved."
  ],
  "mixed": {
    "pl": [
      {
        "key": "case",
        "pattern": "case'|\\bcase\\w*",
        "use": "przypadek"
      },
      {
        "key": "eval",
        "pattern": "\\beval\\w*",
        "use": "ewaluacja, zakładka Ewaluacje"
      },
      {
        "key": "review",
        "pattern": "\\breview\\w*",
        "use": "przegląd"
      },
      {
        "key": "draft",
        "pattern": "\\bdraf(t\\w*|cie)\\b",
        "use": "wersja robocza albo szkic"
      },
      {
        "key": "szkic",
        "pattern": "\\bszkic\\w*",
        "use": "wersja robocza",
        "within": [
          "agents.",
          "agentTemplates.",
          "steps.agents-templates.",
          "chat.delegation.",
          "context.savingReachesEveryAgent",
          "pages.agents.",
          "evals.",
          "authoring.",
          "promotionGate.",
          "datasets.scoring.",
          "onboarding.offer.test-change.",
          "onboarding.steps.agent-",
          "onboarding.steps.agents-templates.",
          "onboarding.steps.flow-agent-",
          "onboarding.steps.flow-test-"
        ],
        "except": [
          "agents.drafterKind",
          "agents.systemKind.drafter",
          "agents.defaultBadge.drafter"
        ],
        "docs": false,
        "note": "Where \"szkic\" would name an unpublished version - an agent's spec, or a file that has none - which is \"wersja robocza\". A text written for somebody to accept - a knowledge gap's content, a generated case - stays \"szkic\", and German says \"Entwurf\" for both. A page cannot tell the two senses apart, so the docs check leaves it out."
      },
      {
        "key": "judge",
        "pattern": "\\bjudge\\w*",
        "use": "sędzia"
      },
      {
        "key": "build",
        "pattern": "\\bbuild\\b",
        "use": "Budowa",
        "note": "The Builder is the page's name and a role's; the tab is Budowa."
      },
      {
        "key": "activity",
        "pattern": "\\bactivity\\b",
        "use": "Aktywność"
      },
      {
        "key": "publish",
        "pattern": "\\bpublish\\b",
        "use": "Opublikuj"
      },
      {
        "key": "assistance",
        "pattern": "asystent\\w* AI",
        "use": "wsparcie AI"
      }
    ],
    "de": [
      {
        "key": "case",
        "pattern": "\\bcase",
        "use": "Fall",
        "note": "A prefix as well as a word, so a compound - \"Case-Generator\" - is caught too."
      },
      {
        "key": "draft",
        "pattern": "\\bdraft",
        "use": "Entwurf"
      },
      {
        "key": "environment",
        "pattern": "\\benvironment",
        "use": "Umgebung"
      },
      {
        "key": "judge",
        "pattern": "\\bjudge",
        "use": "Bewerter"
      },
      {
        "key": "review",
        "pattern": "\\breview(?!er)",
        "use": "Prüfung",
        "note": "A run's Reviewer is a person who approves its tool calls, not the review queue."
      },
      {
        "key": "build",
        "pattern": "\\bbuild\\b(?!-Schritt)",
        "use": "Bauen",
        "note": "The Builder is the page's name and a role's, and a build step is a build step."
      },
      {
        "key": "activity",
        "pattern": "\\bactivity",
        "use": "Aktivität"
      },
      {
        "key": "kaputt",
        "pattern": "kaputt",
        "use": "verschlechtert",
        "within": [
          "evals.",
          "authoring.checkResult.",
          "onboarding.offer.test-change.",
          "onboarding.steps.eval-",
          "onboarding.steps.flow-test-",
          "improvement."
        ],
        "docs": true,
        "note": "What a verdict says of cases; a page that looks broken may still read \"kaputt\"."
      },
      {
        "key": "gebrochen",
        "pattern": "\\bgebroch\\w*",
        "use": "verschlechtert",
        "except": ["pages.runs.cacheBust"],
        "note": "A busted cache is still \"Cache gebrochen\"; a case a version breaks is verschlechtert."
      }
    ]
  },
  "docs": {
    "pages": ["evals", "datasets", "environments", "authoring", "knowledge-gaps"],
    "activityPages": {
      "pl": ["architecture", "concepts", "governance", "triggers", "voice"],
      "de": ["architecture", "concepts", "governance", "triggers", "voice"]
    },
    "allow": {
      "pl": ["Eval judge", "Knowledge gap drafter"],
      "de": ["Eval judge", "Knowledge gap drafter"]
    }
  }
}
